>), etc. Cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.19\">2 S 23:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד הַשְּׁלשָׁה לֹא בָא</span> did not <em>attain</em> (in prowess) <em>unto</em> the three."}],"num":"3."}],"num":"I."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>Conj.</strong>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>until:</em>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">עַד אֲשֶׁר</span> <em>until that:</em> (<em>a</em>) with pf., of <em>past time</em>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:20\" href=\"/Exodus.32.20\">Ex 32:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ויטחן עד אשׁר דָּק</span> (<a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.21\">Dt 9:21</a>), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.14\">Dt 2:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עד אשׁר עָבַרְנוּ</span>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:17\" href=\"/Joshua.3.17\">Jos 3:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:26\" href=\"/Joshua.8.26\">8:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:24\" href=\"/Judges.4.24\">Ju 4:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.7\">1 K 10:7</a> (<a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.6\">2 Ch 9:6</a>), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.20\">2 K 17:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.16\">21:16</a>; with suggestion of <em>degree</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.4\">1 S 30:4</a> (sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.17\">1 K 17:17</a>; rarely of <em>future</em> time (the ‘future perfect,’ Dr<sup>§17</sup>), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.13\">2 S 17:13</a> (of degree), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.21\">Ez 34:21</a>. So <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד שֶׁ</span>- (often in NH; v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שֶׁ·\" href=\"/BDB,_שֶׁ·\", dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ</a>), †<a data-ref=\"Judges 5:7\" href=\"/Judges.5.7\">Ju 5:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.4\">Ct 3:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"r